    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),Type.annotation(@V,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),LA.VectorSpace(V,$\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@ι,Type),Type.annotation(@v,Type.to(ι,V)),Type.annotation(@hIP,InnerProductSpace($\\mathbb{K}$,V))),def[prop](Orthonormal($\\mathbb{K}$,v),,$(\\forall i,\\ \\|v_i\\| = 1) \\wedge (\\forall i \\ne j,\\ \\langle v_i, v_j\\rangle = 0)$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "族 $v$ 规范正交，当且仅当每个 $v_i$ 是单位向量且不同指标对应的向量两两正交；规范正交族必线性无关。Lean 中 `Orthonormal 𝕜 v` 显式接受标量域与族 $v$ 两个参数。",
          "en": "A family $v$ is orthonormal iff each $v_i$ is a unit vector and distinct vectors are pairwise orthogonal; an orthonormal family is automatically linearly independent. In Lean `Orthonormal 𝕜 v` takes exactly the scalar field and the family $v$."
        }
      }
